## SVG Mechanism: API Gateway → Auth Middleware → Service → Cache Flow

A responsive, left-to-right 2D architecture SVG (`viewBox="0 0 920 340"`, 8px coordinate grid, `>= 32px` safe margin) visualizing sequential request flow from **API Gateway** to **Auth Middleware**, **Service**, and **Cache**. Because no project `design/tokens.css` or `tokens.css` was present in the workspace, it uses self-contained light and dark semantic `--color-*` fallback tokens mapped to `--mech-*` SVG aliases in a standalone zero-dependency HTML file saved at [api-gateway-flow.html](file:///C:/Users/ADMIN/AppData/Local/Temp/portable-x5EHY8/api-gateway-flow.html).

### Stages & Token Map

- **Stage 1 — API Gateway** (`x=32..192`, track `1 → 2` to Auth Middleware): accented with `--mech-accent` (`--color-action-primary-bg`).
- **Stage 2 — Auth Middleware** (`x=264..424`, track `2 → 3` to Service): accented with `--mech-warn` (`--color-warning-text`).
- **Stage 3 — Service** (`x=496..656`, track `3 → 4` to Cache): accented with `--mech-accent` (`--color-action-primary-bg`).
- **Stage 4 — Cache** (`x=728..888`): accented with `--mech-ok` (`--color-success-text`).
- **Bound SVG Token Channels** (zero raw hex/rgb attributes inside `<svg>`):
  - **Surfaces & grid:** `--mech-canvas` (`--color-surface-default`), `--mech-node-top` (`--color-surface-raised`), `--mech-node-bottom` (`--color-surface-subtle`), `--mech-node-active-top`, `--mech-node-active-bottom`, `--mech-badge-bg`, `--mech-grid-dot` (`--color-border-default`), `--mech-divider` (`--color-border-default`).
  - **Tracks, borders & focus:** `--mech-node-border` (`--color-border-strong`), `--mech-track` (`--color-border-strong`), `--mech-focus` (`--color-border-focus`).
  - **Signals & semantic accents:** `--mech-accent` (`--color-action-primary-bg`), `--mech-accent-soft`, `--mech-warn` (`--color-warning-text`), `--mech-ok` (`--color-success-text`).
  - **Typography:** `--mech-text` (`--color-text-default`), `--mech-muted` (`--color-text-muted`).

